# netweather Tor sidecar configuration (docs/IMAGE.md 7).
#
# Baked into the image on purpose: the two lines that matter are the ones a
# forgotten mount would silently drop. The monitor only ever reads from this
# proxy, so it carries no exit traffic and opens no control port.
ClientOnly 1
ExitPolicy reject *:*

# The app reaches this over the compose egress network; nothing is published.
SocksPort 0.0.0.0:9050

# The release image runs read-only with a tmpfs at /tmp, and tor needs a
# writable data directory it owns.
DataDirectory /tmp/tor

# Logs go to stdout so `docker logs` keeps them; SafeLogging strips addresses
# from those lines.
Log notice stdout
SafeLogging 1
